  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Ukraine Multidonor Account (2014-2029) - EBRD Ukraine Multidonor Account</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EBRD Ukraine Multidonor Account (2014-2029)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDA is a multi-donor fund which aims at, through technical assistance and capacity strengthening projects, supporting reforms and  policy development in accordance with the EU Aquis of Ukraines economy, business climate, energy efficiency, and sustainable growth. MDAs cooperation partners are Ukrainian public sector entities and selected private sector institutions. The MDA has three priority components, namely public administration, corporate governance, and public private dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDA is a multi-donor fund which aims at, through technical assistance and capacity strengthening projects, supporting reforms and  policy development in accordance with the EU Aquis of Ukraine&#x2019;s economy, business climate, energy efficiency, and sustainable growth. MDA&#x2019;s cooperation partners are Ukrainian public sector entities and selected private sector institutions. The MDA has three priority components, namely public administration, corporate governance, and public private dialogue.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDA &#xe4;r en fond med flera givare som syftar till att, genom tekniskt st&#xf6;d och kapacitetsst&#xe4;rkande projekt, st&#xf6;dja reformer och policyutveckling i enlighet med EU:s regelverk f&#xf6;r Ukrainas ekonomi, f&#xf6;retagsklimat, energieffektivitet och h&#xe5;llbar tillv&#xe4;xt. MDA:s samarbetspartners &#xe4;r ukrainska offentliga akt&#xf6;rer och utvalda privata institutioner. MDA har tre prioriterade komponenter: offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning, bolagsstyrning/f&#xf6;retagsstyrning (corporate govenance), och offentlig-privat dialog (public private dialogue).</narrative>
  </description>
